ion and Project 2025\"</a>. The Independent<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">August 19,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=The+right-wing+organization+in+Trump%E2%80%99s+ear+replacing+the+Heritage+Foundation+and+Project+2025&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.independent.co.uk%2Fnews%2Fworld%2Famericas%2Fus-politics%2Ftrump-america-first-policy-institute-project-2025-b2644777.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-Haberman,_Savage_&amp;_Swan_2023-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Haberman,_Savage_&amp;_Swan_2023_5-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Haberman,_Savage_&amp;_Swan_2023_5-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Haberman,_Savage_&amp;_Swan_2023_5-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHabermanSavageSwan2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maggie_Haberman\" title=\"Maggie Haberman\">Haberman, Maggie</a>; <a href=\"/wiki/Charlie_Savage_(author)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Charlie Savage (author)\">Savage, Charlie</a>; <a href=\"/wiki/Jonathan_Swan\" title=\"Jonathan Swan\">Swan, Jonathan</a> (July 17, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2023/07/17/us/politics/trump-plans-2025.html\">\"Trump and Allies Forge Plans to Increase Presidential Power in 2025\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_York_Times\" title=\"The New York Times\">The New York Times</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20231113042523/https://www.nytimes.com/2023/07/17/us/politics/trump-plans-2025.html\">Archived</a> from the original on November 13, 2023<span 