ginal on November 13, 2023<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 13,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Axios&amp;rft.atitle=Behind+the+Curtain%3A+Trump+Allies+Pre-Screen+Loyalists+for+Unprecedented+Power+Grab&amp;rft.date=2023-11-13&amp;rft.aulast=Allen&amp;rft.aufirst=Mike&amp;rft.au=VandeHei%2C+Jim&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.axios.com%2F2023%2F11%2F13%2Ftrump-loyalists-2024-presidential-election&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-biden_takes_aim-81\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-biden_takes_aim_81-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-biden_takes_aim_81-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFLevien2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Levien, Simon J. (June 27, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2024/06/27/us/politics/biden-trump-project-2025.html\">\"Biden Campaign Takes Aim at Project 2025, a Set of Conservative Proposals\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_York_Times\" title=\"The New York Times\">The New York Times</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240627205306/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/06/27/us/politics/biden-trump-project-2025.html\">Archived</a> from the original on June 27, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 27,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=Biden+Campaign+Takes+Aim+at+Project+2025%2C+a+Set+of+Conservative+Proposals&amp;rft.date=2024-06-27&amp;rft.aulast=Levien&amp;rft.aufirst=Simon+J.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2024%2F06%2F27%2Fus%2Fpolitics%2Fbiden-trump-project-2025.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-82\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-82\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHabermanSavageSwan2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maggie_Haberman\" title=\"Maggie Haberman\">Haberman, Maggie</a>; <a href=\"/wiki/Charlie_Savage_(author)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Charlie Savage (author)\">Savage, Charlie</a>; Swan, Jonathan (November 10, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2023/11/13/us/politics/trump-campaign-2025-statement.html\">\"Trump Campaign Officials Try to Play Down Contentious 2025 Plans\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_York_Times\" title=\"The New York Times\">The New York Times</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20231114231459/https://www.nytimes.com/2023/11/13/us/politics/trump-campaign-2025-statement.html\">Archived</a> from the original on November 14, 2023<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 14,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=Trump+Campaign+Officials+Try+to+Play+Down+Contentious+2025+Plans&amp;rft.date=2023-11-10&amp;rft.aulast=Haberman&amp;rft.aufirst=Maggie&amp;rft.au=Savage%2C+Charlie&amp;rft.au=Swan%2C+Jonathan&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2023%2F11%2F13%2Fus%2Fpolitics%2Ftrump-campaign-2025-statement.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-Layne-2024-83\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Layne-2024_83-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Layne-2024_83-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Layne-2024_83-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFLayne2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Layne, Nathan (July 5, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/trump-seeks-disavow-project-2025-despite-ties-conservative-group-2024-07-05/\">\"Trump seeks to disavow 'Project 2025' despite ties to conservative group\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Reuters\" title=\"Reuters\">Reuters</a><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 27,</span> 2024</span>. <q>Trump's post came three days after Heritage Foundation president Kevin Roberts' comments on Steve Bannon's 'War Room' podcast about a second American Revolution. Democrats and others criticized what they viewed as a veiled threat of violence. [...] Trump's statements and policy positions suggest he is aligned with some but not all of the project's agenda.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Trump+seeks+to+disavow+%27Project+2025%27+despite+ties+to+conservative+group&amp;rft.date=2024-07-05&amp;rft.aulast=Layne&amp;rft.aufirst=Nathan&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.reuters.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Ftrump-seeks-disavow-project-2025-despite-ties-conservative-group-2024-07-05%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-Yang-2024-84\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Yang-2024_84-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFYang2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Yang, Maya (June 6, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/05/donald-trump-project-2025\">\"Donald Trump claims to 'know nothing' about Project 2025\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Guardian\" title=\"The Guardian\">The Guardian</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240712191610/https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/05/donald-trump-project-2025\">Archived</a> from the original on July 12, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 6,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Guardian&amp;rft.atitle=Donald+Trump+claims+to+%27know+nothing%27+about+Project+2025&amp;rft.date=2024-06-06&amp;rft.aulast=Yang&amp;rft.aufirst=Maya&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fus-news%2Farticle%2F2024%2Fjul%2F05%2Fdonald-trump-project-2025&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-Teshome-2024-85\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Teshome-2024_85-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFTeshome2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Teshome, Eden (June 6, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/4756929-michael-steele-donald-trump-project-2025-remarks/\">\"Michael Steele ridicules Trump for post disowning Project 2025\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hill_(newspaper)\" title=\"The Hill (newspaper)\">The Hill</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 25,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Hill&amp;rft.atitle=Michael+Steele+ridicules+Trump+for+post+disowning+Project+2025&amp;rft.date=2024-06-06&amp;rft.aulast=Teshome&amp;rft.aufirst=Eden&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fthehill.com%2Fhomenews%2Fcampaign%2F4756929-michael-steele-donald-trump-project-2025-remarks%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-Troye-2024-86\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Troye-2024_86-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFTroye2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Troye, Olivia (July 8, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2024/07/07/politics/video/trump-distance-project-2025-olivia-troye-nr-digvid\">\"<span class=\"cs1-kern-left\"></span>'Just ludicrous': Ex-Pence advisor on Trump's attempt to distance himself from 'Project 2025'<span class=\"cs1-kern-right\"></span>\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/CNN\" title=\"CNN\">CNN</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240712195530/https://edition.cnn.com/2024/07/07/politics/video/trump-distance-project-2025-olivia-troye-nr-digvid\">Archived</a> from the original on July 12, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 8,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%27Just+ludicrous%27%3A+Ex-Pence+advisor+on+Trump%27s+attempt+to+distance+himself+from+%27Project+2025%27&amp;rft.date=2024-07-08&amp;rft.aulast=Troye&amp;rft.aufirst=Olivia&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fedition.cnn.com%2F2024%2F07%2F07%2Fpolitics%2Fvideo%2Ftrump-distance-project-2025-olivia-troye-nr-digvid&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-unprecedented_power-87\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-unprecedented_power_87-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-unprecedented_power_87-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-unprecedented_power_87-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFOrdoñez2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Ordoñez, Franco (December 6, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.npr.org/2023/12/06/1217562544/trump-and-insiders-craft-plans-for-unprecedented-power\">\"Trump allies craft plans to give him unprecedented power if he wins the White House\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/NPR\" title=\"NPR\">NPR</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240516150608/https://www.npr.org/2023/12/06/1217562544/trump-and-insiders-craft-plans-for-unprecedented-power\">Archived</a> from the original on May 16, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 16,</span> 2024</span>. <q>It's not that the federal service isn't in need of reforms, says Kathryn Dunn Tenpas, a senior fellow at the University of Virginia's Miller Center. But she says Trump wants to create a class of federal workers who will do whatever the president wants—and if they don't, they can be easily fired. 'It's just a dangerous sign,' she says. 'It really suggests that a president wants to aggrandize more authority and more power. And that should make everybody nervous.'<span class=\"cs1-kern-right\"></span></q></cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Trump+allies+craft+plans+to+give+him+unprecedented+power+if+he+wins+the+White+House&amp;rft.date=2023-12-06&amp;rft.aulast=Ordo%C3%B1ez&amp;rft.aufirst=Franco&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.npr.org%2F2023%2F12%2F06%2F1217562544%2Ftrump-and-insiders-craft-plans-for-unprecedented-power&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-88\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-88\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBerryTangColvinKnickmeyer2024\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Berry, Lynn; Tang, Didi; Colvin, Jill; Knickmeyer, Ellen (May 9, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/america-first-trump-biden-russia-ukraine-policy-54080728c6e549c8312c4d71150480ba\">\"Trump-affiliated group releases new national security book outlining possible second-term approach\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Associated_Press\" title=\"Associated Press\">Associated Press</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240625030338/https://apnews.com/article/america-first-trump-biden-russia-ukraine-policy-54080728c6e549c8312c4d71150480ba\">Archived</a> from the original on June 25, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 24,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Trump-affiliated+group+releases+new+national+security+book+outlining+possible+second-term+approach&amp;rft.date=2024-05-09&amp;rft.aulast=Berry&amp;rft.aufirst=Lynn&amp;rft.au=Tang%2C+Didi&amp;rft.au=Colvin%2C+Jill&amp;rft.au=Knickmeyer%2C+Ellen&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Famerica-first-trump-biden-russia-ukraine-policy-54080728c6e549c8312c4d71150480ba&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AProject+2025\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-89\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-89\">^</a></b></span> <span 